	(text "Input 7-26 V (12 V or the 24 V battery bus). D2 SMF26A: 26 V standoff,\n28.9 V min breakdown, 42.1 V clamp at 4.8 A. U1 abs max 38 V.\nU1 TPS560430YF: 2.1 MHz forced PWM. L1, C4 per datasheet table 1 (5 V, 2.1 MHz).\nR1/R2 47k/12k (JLC Basic): 1.0 V x (1 + 47/12) = 4.92 V. EN tied to VIN (UVLO 4 V).\nU5: C4 (3 mm away on the board) is its input cap." (exclude_from_sim no) (at 55.88 76.2 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left bottom)) (uuid "f00a02a5-e157-4f5d-86bf-8b78452cfaeb"))
	(text "J1/J2 (JST GH, DroneCAN order): 1 VBUS, 2 CANH, 3 CANL, 4 GND.\nWired in parallel for daisy-chaining." (exclude_from_sim no) (at 17.78 91.44 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left bottom)) (uuid "fd78d3b9-5611-44c1-a265-0ebbc88d7e12"))
