	(text "U4 TCAN1044AV: VCC 5 V, VIO 3.3 V (logic levels), STB tied low = always normal mode.\nBus pins survive +/-58 V, so a VBUS-to-CAN short at 24 V doesn't kill it.\nClassic CAN 2.0 at 1 Mbit/s on a bus shared with DJI C610s (no FD frames)." (exclude_from_sim no) (at 17.78 157.48 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left bottom)) (uuid "2d17204e-1ac5-4bd5-bd39-0a847fb16176"))
