	(text "Y1 16 MHz into PF0 (HSE bypass), PLL x3 = 48 MHz: CAN needs\nbetter than the HSI's accuracy over temperature.\nSPI1 (AF0): PA5 SCK, PA6 MISO, PA7 MOSI; PA4 CS (GPIO). PB1 = MT6835 CAL_EN.\nbxCAN (classic CAN 2.0, AF4): PA11 RX / PA12 TX, remapped onto pins 19/20\n(set SYSCFG_CFGR1.PA11_PA12_RMP). PB7 = LED. R6 holds BOOT0 (pin 1) low.\nJ3: SWD test pads on the bottom (1 GND, 2 SWDIO, 3 SWCLK, 4 NRST, 5 3V3)." (exclude_from_sim no) (at 193.04 149.86 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left bottom)) (uuid "e14c1082-2d7b-4f6b-9712-41ee14c78459"))
